 ## Amended in session 15b
 
 **The entrance runs on OpenRouter only** (ADR-0015). `ENTRANCE_BACKEND` and the `llama3.1` default are gone; `ENTRANCE_MODEL` still gives it a model of its own.
+
+## Amended in session 15c
+
+**A plan waiting in the chat is answered in words too.** While one waits, the entrance's prompt names it and it is offered `accept_plan` and `turn_down_plan`, which go through the same `Negotiation.answer` a tap does. Which a message is stays the model's judgement; a new ask replaces the plan, a report goes to the logger, anything else is answered with the plan still waiting.
