+## Amended in session 15c
+
+**A proposal moved past ends `stopped`, written then; never a new ending.** The moments are known, so item 7 applies:
+
+- a new ask over a pending proposal (`Negotiation.open`); asked in the chat, its run follows the stopped one in the same negotiation;
+- a report of the workout a pending adaptation was for: the adaptation's day is over, so it is ended and cleared from the checkpointer.
+
+`trainer runs` reads a run live on two threads (the entrance and the subgraph it handed to) where it moved last.
+
 ## Consequences
 
 - **`record.Run` goes.** The model, provider and budget carried in the run's config were the identity of a run answered by one model; the model belongs to the node that did the work and goes in the record's node entries.
